      "writtenOn": "2026-08-28T12:02:14Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Thanks for the review. I agree the ownership should stay in the IPMI host path, not in networkd. The actual issue was a self-owned D-Bus write in host-ipmid, so I’m keeping the fix at the IPMI side and not moving channel access policy into networkd.",
